    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970417.0009\n\nMANILA, April 17 , 1997 (AFP)\n\nManila shares close 1.1 percent lower\n\n\n\n\nPhilippine share prices fell 1.1 percent Thursday on fears of further US interest rate hikes, analysts said.\n\nThe Philippine Stock Exchange composite index fell 33.1 points to close at 2,927.87 points.",
